{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-03",
  "title": "鳴銃示警",
  "storyCode": "10-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b59956ee726962a482c221d5a52cfae0be79c4fdfd5789629d4628f822973603",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "啊！升降梯倒了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "再往下一點點，我、我的腿就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......拉住我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "我是說拉住我的造物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "笨蛋......你別把我也拽倒了啊！帶著你們，我本來就很難浮起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "長、長官......謝謝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "下回滾得更機靈些，少給我添亂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "長官，小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "這是......是炮彈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "不，要比一般的榴彈炮厲害得多......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......而且，僅僅瞄準了這一小塊區域？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "曼弗雷德......你是不是早就在看著了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "該死的心機深沉的魔族佬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "聽好了，都給我停止行動！這些薩卡茲沒有追的必要了，至於那個司機......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "這倒楣地方......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "text": "中尉，這、這是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "............",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "text": "城防炮怎麼會......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "......倫蒂尼姆的防禦牆建成近七十年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "這是第一次......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "牆上的防禦炮，瞄準目標包含了......城內。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "威力不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "只用上了一成火力，就能輕鬆熔毀普通結構。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......這可是倫蒂尼姆的城防武器。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "還只是副炮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "我們的武器專家說，如果我能啟動主炮，這些炮能輕鬆擊穿任意一艘高速戰艦的裝甲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "武器專家......是那位城防軍工兵隊的軍官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "多虧你幫我抓到了他和他的妻女。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......他還活著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "薩卡茲還用得上他，他就不會死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "炮手，瞄準十一號升降梯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "......偏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "可惜，準度還需要提升。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "畢竟這些炮口原本只能對外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "對外......在我們進入倫蒂尼姆之前，這些城防炮瞄準的是城外大公爵的軍隊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "當我們假借平息公爵爭端的名義入城的時候，它們甚至都沒有把我們的人納入過瞄準範圍——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "這也算對外嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "自從高盧戰敗、伊比利亞沉寂之後，維多利亞已很久不需要應對實質上的外敵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "嗯，所以殿下為我們謀到了這個機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "如此精良的武器，本就該發揮更大作用，而不是架在這裡，充當點綴門楣的裝飾品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "炮手，啟動活動目標動態追蹤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "很好，成功了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "給它們調整朝向就耗費了我們整整一個月的時間......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "所幸效果基本達標。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "控制住了這批武器，就意味著我們真正控制住了倫蒂尼姆的出入口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "等我們把所有城防炮都調整好......就再沒有人能躲在鋼鐵高牆的蔭蔽之下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "炮火似乎被深池引開了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "這是......一次試驗？他們的目的難道僅僅只是驗證......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "不，他們真正的目標並不是這出入口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "text": "中尉，我們怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "......繼續往城內方向撤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "只是......薩迪恩區的其他地方也不再安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "薩卡茲對倫蒂尼姆的控制正在收緊。只要城防炮對準城內一天，我們的性命就隨時都捏在他們手裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "除非......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
      "text": "您在想什麼，中尉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "號角",
      "text": "沒什麼。走吧，先離開這裡再說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "這該死的城牆，該死的炮！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "長官，您的造物又被擊碎了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "我根本......來不及！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "別愣著了，滾，有多快滾多快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......逼著我們從這裡逃跑是吧？曼弗雷德，你今天這麼戲耍我，我早晚都......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "長官，我剛才看到有個熟悉的人影朝相反方向跑了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "那個人......褐色頭髮的魯珀？是她？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "給我攔下——\n唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "長官，小心！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你做什麼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "text": "長官，我擋著，您快走，快走吧......您還要替領袖......找......找到......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "......好，好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "你是第十三個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "text": "十三條塔拉人的命。我會替領袖記住，有朝一日，我要親手、成倍地問薩卡茲討回來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "將軍，深池的隊伍完全被打散了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "看見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "但我們沒注意到反抗軍......這幫狡猾的蟲豸！他們好像就露了一下頭，城防炮啟動以後，就又不見了蹤影。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "呃，他們會不會已經被打死了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "你信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "我......我就覺得我們的工作不至於這麼輕鬆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "明白就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "那他們是混進逃走的人群裡了嗎？要不要通知巡邏隊，讓他們攔住平民，繼續搜捕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "繼續炮轟出入口。對了，加大力度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "text": "加大火力？出入口已經爛得差不多了，不太可能藏人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "他們不會再走這條路了。而且，你見過薩卡茲拔刀只拔一半的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "既然動了手，不如讓他們看看清楚，我們能做到什麼程度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......你是故意在他們面前彰顯力量。你想......斷了他們的後路，逼他們自己走出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "這場捉迷藏耗時夠久了。即便我還能等，殿下們與諸王庭也都已失去耐心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "text": "不論是誰，有所圖謀的話，我只想麻煩他們快一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "博士，附近沒有一處位置是絕對安全的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "就算我們全部撤到了這塊結構下面，也還是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "......也還是隨時都會被這個炮打穿啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "我粗略估計過了，別說我們頭頂這塊外牆底板，這炮要是火力全開的話，就連正式的移動城市地塊也能擊穿！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "推進之王，你們倫蒂尼姆的炮真不是開玩笑啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "......這也是我第一次見它們大規模啟動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "那我們受到的歡迎還挺有規格囉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "規格再提升的話，我們會在距城牆五十公里處灰飛煙滅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "啊啊啊要撐不住了啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "text": "阿米婭，我的無人機也加固不了這底板結構了，照這麼轟下去，我們早晚一起被炸飛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我們必須離開這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "深池士兵也在用最快的速度撤退......但他們用上了法術造物做掩體，還會丟下受傷的士兵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民",
      "text": "嗚......啊......為什麼我們這麼倒楣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民",
      "text": "是不是我們都會死在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "我們不能丟下這些倫蒂尼姆市民。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "偵察小組，你們看到炮手了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "沒有嗎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "我們恐怕找不到炮手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "推進之王",
      "text": "倫蒂尼姆的城防炮，與我們面前的高牆，本來就是一體的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......也就是說，如果我們沒法登上高牆或者進入高牆內部，就不可能停止這場轟炸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "沒人能頂著炮轟登牆。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們找不到進入城牆內部的途徑。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "text": "躲在這等死也不是辦法！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "text": "要不然，我出去引開這炮火？以我的本事，至少能堅持個幾分鐘......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "text": "不行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "達格達",
          "text": "......她一個不行的話，我們一起去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "你們別添亂了好不好？達格達，你是不是跟因陀羅混久了，腦子裡也都只剩下肌肉？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "達格達",
          "text": "呃......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "要是讓人出去當誘餌是可行的，哪裡輪得到你們倆在這裡爭？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "我們拿的防具，最多挨兩下正規軍的弩箭，這已經是工程部的朋友們努力了幾個月的成果了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "摩根",
          "text": "你們這麼急著去送死的話，就壓根不該跟來倫蒂尼姆！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "text": "好吧，我聽你的，但我絕對不會讓維娜在這裡出事！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "text": "我們甚至......連家門都還沒進！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你們出去確實沒用。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "還沒到說這些話的時候。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "text": "博士，你是不是有想法了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "無人機。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "無人機......哦哦，我懂了......我說嘛，果然是這個邏輯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "text": "你在說什麼啊可露希爾？博士話是少，但你不要說了跟沒說一個樣子啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "抱歉啊，我在想方案呢。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "這防禦炮還挺智慧的，射程範圍這麼大，它不可能完全依靠手動瞄準，所以它肯定會以某種方式鎖定地面附近的活動目標。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "一兩個人出去是沒辦法讓炮火從我們頭頂移開的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "可如果我的無人機全部出動，對瞄準演算法來說，威脅性說不定能超過我們小隊加上所有平民......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "因陀羅",
          "text": "只是說不定嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "誰也沒法保證啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "text": "可露希爾，加固失敗，超出無人機承壓閾值！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "text": "不出三十秒，這底板一定會塌......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "我們只能試試看了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "等博士指示，全員做好撤出準備。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "五、四、三——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "二——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "走！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "無人機發射！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "大家快跑！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......成功了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "text": "只是這一小會，讓我們轉移到了沒幾步遠的這地方......這塊結構同樣支撐不了多久。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "而且沒有下一次機會了啊，我的寶貝無人機全被打爛了，就算是我，也沒法原地給你們再變一批出來......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "往前往後都不算安全，想逃出轟炸區，我們還是要冒很大的險。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "能有一條讓我們繞開這裡的路就好了......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "聽說你們在找路？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "欸欸？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "text": "誰在這裡？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "卡特斯小姐，我想和你們談一談。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "但在此之前，你最好讓你的手下把武器都從我身上移開。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "你——你是什麼人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "自我介紹得稍後再說了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "鋼爪，砍刀，還有這位......呃，這位手上的錘子？女士，你的武器看起來非常帥，但能不能不要對著我的腦袋？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "推進之王",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "不然的話，你們的這位朋友可能會有生命危險。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "——博士！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "啊？發生了什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "他說的是我？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "誰都別靠近。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "只要有人走近一步，這位朋友的後腦勺就會原地爆開。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "阿、阿米婭，是無人機......！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "有一架無人機，趁我們大家不注意，偷偷繞了過去，現在正貼在博士後腦勺上啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "尖耳朵的女士，你很識貨。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "實話說，我對你們真的越來越好奇了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "大家，放下武器。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "嗯，這才對嘛。不過別忘記撤掉角落裡那些弩。我敢打賭，自從我站到你們面前，你們的狙擊手就沒眨過眼睛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "......照他說的做。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "不錯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "——先生。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "請你相信我，我們從來不會主動地給任何陌生人造成傷害。但是——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "text": "但凡你敢傷害你面前的人，請同樣相信我，我可以不依賴任何武器，現在，立刻，讓你永遠失去威脅別人的能力。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "咳咳......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "text": "唔呃......這地方已經夠危險了，動手之前我們可能都會被炸死啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "沒錯，要是不想一起被薩卡茲炸成禮花的話，我們恐怕沒時間站在這裡互相指腦袋了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "各位，我有個建議，請你們放棄抵抗，跟我走一趟。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "在到地方之前，你們這位朋友還是借我一用——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不好吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我能拒絕嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "抱歉，你暫時沒有選擇的權利。請乖乖跟我走吧，看不見臉的朋友。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
